1275
01:29:53.734 --> 01:29:55.533
- Okay.

1276
01:29:57.101 --> 01:29:59.067
- I just...
- Oh, I know.

1277
01:29:59.068 --> 01:30:00.967
- I just can't take this.

1278
01:30:00.968 --> 01:30:03.734
- I know, honey, I know.

1279
01:30:29.007 --> 01:30:30.606
