- Take you, Michael.
- Take you, Michael.

1294
01:32:35.727 --> 01:32:39.060
- To be my husband.
- To be my husband.

1295
01:32:39.061 --> 01:32:41.827
- I do promise
in covenant before God.

1296
01:32:41.828 --> 01:32:44.094
- I do promise in covenant before God.

1297
01:32:44.095 --> 01:32:45.794
- And these witnesses.

1298
01:32:45.795 --> 01:32:47.296
- And these witnesses.

1299
01:32:47.297 --> 01:32:49.561
- To be your
loving and faithful wife.

1300
01:32:49.562 --> 01:32:51.695
- To be your loving and faithful wife.

1301
01:32:51.696 --> 01:32:53.596
- In plenty and in want.

1302
01:32:53.597 --> 01:32:55.496
- In plenty and in want.

1303
01:32:55.497 --> 01:32:57.596
- In joy and in sorrow.

