01:32:57.597 --> 01:32:59.697
- In joy and in sorrow.

1305
01:32:59.698 --> 01:33:01.597
- In sickness and in health.

1306
01:33:01.598 --> 01:33:03.563
- In sickness and in health.

1307
01:33:03.564 --> 01:33:07.831
- For as long
as we both shall live.

1308
01:33:07.832 --> 01:33:10.799
- For as long as we both shall live.

1309
01:34:11.710 --> 01:34:13.742
- I thought I
had accepted God's plan

1310
01:34:13.743 --> 01:34:16.209
